---
description: implementation rules
alwaysApply: false
---

* pyproject.toml
* Dedicated virtual environment
* Prefer Python version 3.13, avoid latest releases
* Type hints and typing syntax compatible with Python version
* No unnecessary Any
* Architecture boundaries
* External API isolation
* External integrations mockable
* Secrets/configuration handling
* Prefer simpler implementations consistent with architecture
* Prefer docstings and self-documenting code